WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.568
-Now, we all love
our pets, right?

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:05.405
And every pet owner
thinks their pet is the best.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.539
-Homer!

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.208
-Well -- Homer, yes.
Shout-out to Homer.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.310
Well, I wanted to see
if that was true,

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.846
so it's time for "Why Is
Your Pet Better Than Me?"

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:16.449
-♪ Why Is Your Pet
Better Than Me?♪

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.051
♪ Better Than Me♪

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.452
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:21.020
-All right.
Let's meet our first pet.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.156
Hello. What is your name
and where are you from?

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.992
-My name's Teresa Hanula,
and this is Leonard,

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:28.127
and we're from
Fairfax, Virginia.

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:31.798
-Hi, Teresa. Hi, Leonard.

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:35.001
Teresa, tell me about your dog.
Tell me about Leonard.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:37.336
-Well, Leonard
is a 3-year-old Border Collie

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:39.405
who loves to learn new tricks,

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:41.941
and one of his favorite tricks
is to paint.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.676
-To paint? Wow!
-Paint.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.378
-So, I'm already --
I'm already guessing, yeah,

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.913
this is why your pet
is better than me.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.948
Your dog paints?

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.483
-He paints,
and even though he's a dog

00:00:51.483 --> 00:00:53.619
and he's just 3,
he's probably done

00:00:53.619 --> 00:00:56.455
about 100 of his own
abstract paintings.

00:00:56.455 --> 00:00:57.857
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.593
All right. Leonard.
Can we see what Leonard doe--

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.495
Sorry to bore you, Leonard.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.464
Uh, can we see
what Leonard does?

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:07.400
-Ready? Take. Good!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.335
Now go paint it!

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.270
Good! There you go. Paint it.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.238
-Wow.
-Yes! Wait.

00:01:13.238 --> 00:01:15.708
Gonna put it...

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.211
Oh. Hey. Go paint it.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:20.679
Yes. Go paint it. Yeah!

00:01:20.679 --> 00:01:22.281
-Leonard, this is --
-Now go clean up.

00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:23.950
-Oh, my gosh.
-Good boy!

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:26.386
-You impressed us, Leonard.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:27.520
-Yeah! Good!

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.954
-Well, he's got --
he's got one more color.

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:30.757
Yeah, go for it. Yeah, Leonard,
let's see another color.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.393
You want to do another one
-Good boy, Leonard! Good!

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.495
-There you go.
That's right, Leonard.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:38.064
Yes. That's right.
That's a good boy.

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:39.265
-Good!
-Now he's done. He's done.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:40.733
-Leonard!

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:44.003
-It's a masterpiece, Leonard!
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.505
That is what I'm talking about.

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:48.574
Leonard. Oh, my gosh.

00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:51.043
He's so talented.
Thank you so much.

00:01:51.043 --> 00:01:52.745
We're going to let Leonard
keep working.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:55.114
We're going to check in with him
later to see how he's doing

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:56.582
with his painting.

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:58.551
Let's see our next pet
over here.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:01.287
Hey. What's your name
and where you from?

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.122
-Hi. I'm Jeff Dalebout.

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:04.858
And these are my daughters,
Haley and Kelsey,

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:06.892
and we're from Provo, Utah.

00:02:06.892 --> 00:02:10.663
-Haley. Kelsey. Hi!

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.999
Hi, Haley. Hi, Kelsey.
Welcome, guys.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:15.601
And who do you have there
with you?

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.069
-This is Kittywinski.

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:19.738
He's a one-year-old male Tabby.

00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:22.107
-Kitty -- Kittywinski.

00:02:22.107 --> 00:02:23.776
-Yes.
-Very good.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:25.678
Now, you said that
so matter of factly

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:26.979
like that's a common name.

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:29.415
You go, "Yes, of course.
Yes, of course. Kittywinski."

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:32.318
Tell me -- Can you tell me
why is your pet better than me?

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.786
[ Cat meows ]

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:37.222
-Kittywinski's a composer, and
he plays all of his own music.

00:02:37.222 --> 00:02:40.927
-[ Laughs ] Okay.
Let's -- Let's -- Let's see it.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.929
Let's be real quiet
and let's hear Kittywinski.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.163
Here we go.

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:47.066
-Can you play? Can you play?

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:48.200
Kittywinski, play.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.169
Can you play?

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.004
[ Two piano notes play ]

00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:54.140
Kittywinski, play.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.109
Play.

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:57.443
-Ooh.

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:58.811
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.379
-There you go.

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:02.915
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:05.618
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:08.054
That was a short song there,
but, hey, you know, he's back.

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:11.090
Kittywinski. Good job.
Thank you very much.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.625
That was two notes on --

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.660
All right.
Let's meet our last pet here.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.929
Welcome. What is your name
and where are you from?

00:03:16.929 --> 00:03:18.764
-Hello.
My name's Holly Ashbrook.

00:03:18.764 --> 00:03:20.433
And I'm from
Manchester, England.

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:21.734
-Manchester!

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.035
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:23.035 --> 00:03:25.904
Yes! I'm so happy you are here.

00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:28.874
Please tell us a little bit
about your pets.

00:03:28.874 --> 00:03:31.177
-Okay, so,
this girl here is Yuki,

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:33.012
and she's a Japanese Spitz.

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:35.214
And this little boy here is Ted,

00:03:35.214 --> 00:03:38.050
and he is a Jack Russell
cross Miniature Pinscher.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.919
-[ Laughs ]
They're very cute.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:43.455
Can you tell me, why are
your pets better than me?

00:03:43.455 --> 00:03:46.825
-Well, Jimmy, I believe
my pets are better than you

00:03:46.825 --> 00:03:49.796
because they can dance
when I sing.

00:03:49.796 --> 00:03:51.364
-They dance when you sing.
All right.

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:53.265
That sounds amazing.
I'm ready to see this.

00:03:53.265 --> 00:03:55.301
Let's see this.

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:59.172
-Okay. Yuki, come here.

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:02.008
♪ If you're happy and
you know it, do a spin ♪

00:04:02.074 --> 00:04:04.810
♪ If you're happy and
you know it, do a spin ♪

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.479
♪ If you're happy
and you know it ♪

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:07.947
♪ And you really
want to show it ♪

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:10.116
♪ If you're happy and
you know it, do a spin ♪

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:12.184
-There you go. That's not bad.

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:13.953
Oh, they give a high five?

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:16.055
[ Laughs ] Come on.

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.990
That's what I'm talking about
right there.

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:20.025
That is fantastic. Thank you!

00:04:20.025 --> 00:04:23.329
Let's check back in with Leonard
and see how Leonard's doing.

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:26.365
Leonard. Oh, my gosh.
Leonard. Oh, my goodness.

00:04:26.365 --> 00:04:29.568
That's unbelievable. That is --

00:04:29.568 --> 00:04:33.006
I want to thank
all of our talented pets,

00:04:33.006 --> 00:04:35.107
Leonard, Kittywinski,
Ted and Yuki.

00:04:35.107 --> 00:04:37.943
If you have a pet that
you think is better than me

00:04:37.943 --> 00:04:42.014
and want to see, go to...

00:04:42.014 --> 00:04:44.083
to submit a video of your pet.

